------------------------------------------------------

      Application
         |
         | INSERT Query + New Row Data
         v
      Database
         |
         v
    Partitioning Key Value Available?
         |
    +----+----+
    |         |
   YES        NO
    |         |
    v         v
Apply        Database cannot determine
Partitioning correct target Partition
Rule             |
   |             v
   v          INSERT cannot be
Identify      correctly routed
Correct
Partition
   |
   v
