## SHARDING vs PARTITIONING ?
--------------------------------

Database Partitioning mein data ko Rows ya Columns ke basis par multiple
logical partitions mein divide kiya jaata hai aur ye partitions same 
database node ke andar manage hote hain.

Sharding mein data ko generally Rows ke basis par horizontally divide karke
multiple independent Database Nodes/Shards ke across distribute kiya jaata hai.
Sharding ko broadly Horizontal Partitioning ka distributed form samjha jaa sakta hai.



